      "description": "Soft, slightly oversized, and quietly detailed \u2014 this crewneck brings heritage-inspired embroidery into everyday wear. The embroidered chest patch and matching back emblem read like a woven memory: warm rusts and earthy motifs that sit gently against a clean ivory canvas. It feels like slipping into a favorite library chair after a long walk: relaxed shoulders, a soft midweight heft, and a collar that keeps its shape. Wear it with faded denim, layered under a coat, or draped over a linen dress. The stitched accents give a subtle, artisanal touch that stands out without shouting, and the tear-away neck label keeps the inside as comfortable as the outside.<br/><br/>Product features<br/>- Embroidered accents at chest, back, and optional wrist placements<br/>- Midweight 50/50 cotton-poly blend (8.0 oz/yd\u00b2) for warmth and durability<br/>- Tubular knit (no side seams) for cleaner drape and reduced waste<br/>- Ribbed knit collar and double-needle stitching for long-lasting shape<br/>- DTF inner neck labels; OEKO-TEX\u00ae certified dyes and ethically grown US cotton<br/><br/>Care instructions<br/>- Machine wash: cold (max 30C or 90F)<br/>- Non-chlorine: bleach as needed<br/>- Tumble dry: low heat<br/>- Do not dryclean<br/>- Do not iron<br/>",
